{
  "title": "Stage 3: Percentiles",
  "summary": "Sort durations, pick percentiles with ElementAt, and page through results with Skip and Take.",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "learn",
      "title": "Briefing: slow, but how slow?",
      "body": [
        "An average hides the pain. Nine fast requests and one 5-second request average to \"fine\", but one user in ten waited five seconds. Operators use **percentiles** instead: p50 (the median) is the typical request, p95 is the slow end.",
        "",
        "The simplest definition is *nearest rank*: sort the durations; the p-th percentile is the item at rank `ceil(p × n / 100)`, counting from 1.",
        "",
        "```csharp",
        "int Percentile(List<int> sorted, int p)",
        "{",
        "    var rank = (p * sorted.Count + 99) / 100;   // ceil without floating point",
        "    return sorted.ElementAt(rank - 1);          // ranks count from 1",
        "}",
        "```",
        "",
        "`ElementAt(i)` returns the item at a position in any sequence. On a `List` it is the same as `sorted[i]`; on a lazy query it walks forward `i` steps, like `Skip(i).First()`.",
        "",
        "The per-endpoint numbers come from a `Select` with a block body, which is fine when the projection needs a local variable:",
        "",
        "```csharp fragment",
        ".Select(g =>",
        "{",
        "    var sorted = g.Select(e => e.Ms).Order().ToList();",
        "    return new { Endpoint = g.Key, P95 = Percentile(sorted, 95), Max = sorted[^1] };",
        "})",
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "prompt": "Nearest-rank percentiles. What does this print?",
      "code": [
        "var ms = new List<int> { 400, 20, 30, 1000, 25, 35, 40, 30, 22, 28 }.Order().ToList();",
        "",
        "int Percentile(List<int> sorted, int p) => sorted.ElementAt((p * sorted.Count + 99) / 100 - 1);",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine($\"p50={Percentile(ms, 50)} p90={Percentile(ms, 90)} p95={Percentile(ms, 95)}\");"
      ],
      "answer": "p50=30 p90=400 p95=1000",
      "explain": "Sorted: 20 22 25 28 30 30 35 40 400 1000. With n = 10, p50 is rank 5 (30), p90 is rank 9 (400), p95 is rank ceil(9.5) = 10 (1000). The average, 163, describes nobody."
    },
    {
      "type": "predict",
      "prompt": "`Skip` and `Take` page through a sorted list. What does this print?",
      "code": [
        "var ms = new[] { 5, 90, 12, 300, 41, 7 };",
        "",
        "var sorted = ms.OrderByDescending(m => m).ToList();",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine(string.Join(\" \", sorted.Take(2)));",
        "Console.WriteLine(string.Join(\" \", sorted.Skip(2).Take(2)));",
        "Console.WriteLine(sorted.ElementAt(4));"
      ],
      "answer": [
        "300 90",
        "41 12",
        "7"
      ],
      "explain": "Descending: 300 90 41 12 7 5. `Take(2)` is the first page, `Skip(2).Take(2)` the second, and `ElementAt(4)` is the fifth item (positions start at 0)."
    },
    {
      "type": "blanks",
      "prompt": "Complete the per-endpoint latency summary.",
      "code": [
        "var slowest = entries",
        "    .GroupBy(e => e.Endpoint)",
        "    .Select(g =>",
        "    {",
        "        var sorted = g.Select(e => e.Ms).__1__().ToList();",
        "        return new { Endpoint = g.Key, P95 = Percentile(sorted, 95), Max = sorted[__2__] };",
        "    })",
        "    .__3__(x => x.P95)",
        "    .ThenBy(x => x.Endpoint)",
        "    .Take(3);"
      ],
      "blanks": [
        "Order",
        "^1",
        "OrderByDescending"
      ],
      "bank": [
        "Reverse",
        "0",
        "OrderBy",
        "Count"
      ],
      "explain": "`Order()` sorts the durations ascending, so the maximum is the last item, `sorted[^1]`. The endpoints are then ranked slowest-first with `OrderByDescending`."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "title": "Slowest endpoints",
      "carry": true,
      "prompt": [
        "After the endpoint counts, print the three slowest endpoints by p95.",
        "",
        "1. Write `int Percentile(List<int> sorted, int p)` using nearest rank: rank `(p * n + 99) / 100`, item `ElementAt(rank - 1)`.",
        "2. Print an empty line, `Slowest endpoints:`, then for the three endpoints with the highest p95 (ties alphabetically):",
        "",
        "`endpoint: p50=Nms p95=Nms max=Nms n=COUNT`",
        "",
        "For this input:",
        "",
        "```text",
        "2026-03-04T09:00:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders 200 110ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:00:20 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders/7 200 45ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:01:00 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 320ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:02:30 10.0.0.1 POST /api/orders 201 180ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:05:00 10.0.0.3 GET /health 200 2ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:10:00 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 410ms",
        "not a log line",
        "2026-03-04T09:45:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders 200 130ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:46:10 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 500 2300ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:46:15 10.0.0.4 GET /api/search 500 2100ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:46:40 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 390ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:47:00 10.0.0.4 POST /api/orders 503 30ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:50:00 10.0.0.3 GET /health 200 3ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:52:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders/7 404 12ms",
        "2026-03-04T10:30:00 10.0.0.3 GET /health 200 2ms",
        "2026-03-04T10:31:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders 200 105ms",
        "2026-03-04T10:31:30 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 350ms",
        "2026-03-04 10:32:00 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 350ms",
        "2026-03-04T09:40:00 10.0.0.4 GET /api/search 200 15ms",
        "2026-03-04T10:33:00 10.0.0.4 GET /api/search 200 18ms",
        "```",
        "",
        "print exactly:",
        "",
        "```text",
        "Parsed: 18, skipped: 2",
        "",
        "Status codes:",
        "200: 13",
        "201: 1",
        "404: 1",
        "500: 2",
        "503: 1",
        "",
        "Top endpoints:",
        "GET /api/search: 8",
        "GET /api/orders: 3",
        "GET /health: 3",
        "",
        "Slowest endpoints:",
        "GET /api/search: p50=350ms p95=2300ms max=2300ms n=8",
        "POST /api/orders: p50=30ms p95=180ms max=180ms n=2",
        "GET /api/orders: p50=110ms p95=130ms max=130ms n=3",
        "```"
      ],
      "starter": [
        "using System.Globalization;",
        "",
        "var lines = new List<string>();",
        "string? line;",
        "while ((line = Console.ReadLine()) is not null)",
        "    lines.Add(line);",
        "",
        "var candidates = lines.Where(l => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(l)).ToList();",
        "",
        "var entries = candidates",
        "    .Select(TryParseEntry)",
        "    .OfType<Entry>()",
        "    .ToList();",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine($\"Parsed: {entries.Count}, skipped: {candidates.Count - entries.Count}\");",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine();",
        "Console.WriteLine(\"Status codes:\");",
        "foreach (var (status, count) in entries.CountBy(e => e.Status).OrderBy(p => p.Key))",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"{status}: {count}\");",
        "",
        "var topEndpoints = entries",
        "    .GroupBy(e => e.Endpoint)",
        "    .Select(g => new { Endpoint = g.Key, Hits = g.Count() })",
        "    .OrderByDescending(x => x.Hits)",
        "    .ThenBy(x => x.Endpoint)",
        "    .Take(3);",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine();",
        "Console.WriteLine(\"Top endpoints:\");",
        "foreach (var x in topEndpoints)",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"{x.Endpoint}: {x.Hits}\");",
        "",
        "Entry? TryParseEntry(string line)",
        "{",
        "    var parts = line.Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries);",
        "    if (parts is not [var stamp, var ip, var method, var path, var status, var took])",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (method is not (\"GET\" or \"POST\" or \"PUT\" or \"DELETE\"))",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (!DateTime.TryParseExact(stamp, \"yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss\", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, DateTimeStyles.None, out var time))",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (!int.TryParse(status, out var code))",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (!took.EndsWith(\"ms\") || !int.TryParse(took[..^2], out var ms))",
        "        return null;",
        "    return new Entry(time, ip, method, path, code, ms);",
        "}",
        "",
        "record Entry(DateTime Time, string Ip, string Method, string Path, int Status, int Ms)",
        "{",
        "    public string Endpoint => $\"{Method} {Path}\";",
        "}"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "using System.Globalization;",
        "",
        "var lines = new List<string>();",
        "string? line;",
        "while ((line = Console.ReadLine()) is not null)",
        "    lines.Add(line);",
        "",
        "var candidates = lines.Where(l => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(l)).ToList();",
        "",
        "var entries = candidates",
        "    .Select(TryParseEntry)",
        "    .OfType<Entry>()",
        "    .ToList();",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine($\"Parsed: {entries.Count}, skipped: {candidates.Count - entries.Count}\");",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine();",
        "Console.WriteLine(\"Status codes:\");",
        "foreach (var (status, count) in entries.CountBy(e => e.Status).OrderBy(p => p.Key))",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"{status}: {count}\");",
        "",
        "var topEndpoints = entries",
        "    .GroupBy(e => e.Endpoint)",
        "    .Select(g => new { Endpoint = g.Key, Hits = g.Count() })",
        "    .OrderByDescending(x => x.Hits)",
        "    .ThenBy(x => x.Endpoint)",
        "    .Take(3);",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine();",
        "Console.WriteLine(\"Top endpoints:\");",
        "foreach (var x in topEndpoints)",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"{x.Endpoint}: {x.Hits}\");",
        "",
        "var slowest = entries",
        "    .GroupBy(e => e.Endpoint)",
        "    .Select(g =>",
        "    {",
        "        var sorted = g.Select(e => e.Ms).Order().ToList();",
        "        return new",
        "        {",
        "            Endpoint = g.Key,",
        "            Count = sorted.Count,",
        "            P50 = Percentile(sorted, 50),",
        "            P95 = Percentile(sorted, 95),",
        "            Max = sorted[^1]",
        "        };",
        "    })",
        "    .OrderByDescending(x => x.P95)",
        "    .ThenBy(x => x.Endpoint)",
        "    .Take(3);",
        "",
        "Console.WriteLine();",
        "Console.WriteLine(\"Slowest endpoints:\");",
        "foreach (var x in slowest)",
        "    Console.WriteLine($\"{x.Endpoint}: p50={x.P50}ms p95={x.P95}ms max={x.Max}ms n={x.Count}\");",
        "",
        "Entry? TryParseEntry(string line)",
        "{",
        "    var parts = line.Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries);",
        "    if (parts is not [var stamp, var ip, var method, var path, var status, var took])",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (method is not (\"GET\" or \"POST\" or \"PUT\" or \"DELETE\"))",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (!DateTime.TryParseExact(stamp, \"yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss\", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, DateTimeStyles.None, out var time))",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (!int.TryParse(status, out var code))",
        "        return null;",
        "    if (!took.EndsWith(\"ms\") || !int.TryParse(took[..^2], out var ms))",
        "        return null;",
        "    return new Entry(time, ip, method, path, code, ms);",
        "}",
        "",
        "int Percentile(List<int> sorted, int p)",
        "{",
        "    var rank = (p * sorted.Count + 99) / 100;",
        "    return sorted.ElementAt(rank - 1);",
        "}",
        "",
        "record Entry(DateTime Time, string Ip, string Method, string Path, int Status, int Ms)",
        "{",
        "    public string Endpoint => $\"{Method} {Path}\";",
        "}"
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "name": "a day of traffic",
          "stdin": [
            "2026-03-04T09:00:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders 200 110ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:00:20 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders/7 200 45ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:01:00 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 320ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:02:30 10.0.0.1 POST /api/orders 201 180ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:05:00 10.0.0.3 GET /health 200 2ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:10:00 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 410ms",
            "not a log line",
            "2026-03-04T09:45:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders 200 130ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:46:10 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 500 2300ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:46:15 10.0.0.4 GET /api/search 500 2100ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:46:40 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 390ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:47:00 10.0.0.4 POST /api/orders 503 30ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:50:00 10.0.0.3 GET /health 200 3ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:52:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders/7 404 12ms",
            "2026-03-04T10:30:00 10.0.0.3 GET /health 200 2ms",
            "2026-03-04T10:31:00 10.0.0.1 GET /api/orders 200 105ms",
            "2026-03-04T10:31:30 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 350ms",
            "2026-03-04 10:32:00 10.0.0.2 GET /api/search 200 350ms",
            "2026-03-04T09:40:00 10.0.0.4 GET /api/search 200 15ms",
            "2026-03-04T10:33:00 10.0.0.4 GET /api/search 200 18ms"
          ],
          "expect": [
            "Parsed: 18, skipped: 2",
            "",
            "Status codes:",
            "200: 13",
            "201: 1",
            "404: 1",
            "500: 2",
            "503: 1",
            "",
            "Top endpoints:",
            "GET /api/search: 8",
            "GET /api/orders: 3",
            "GET /health: 3",
            "",
            "Slowest endpoints:",
            "GET /api/search: p50=350ms p95=2300ms max=2300ms n=8",
            "POST /api/orders: p50=30ms p95=180ms max=180ms n=2",
            "GET /api/orders: p50=110ms p95=130ms max=130ms n=3"
